  "description": "Yong Seong-Il, about to enter music school, spends his days living a debaucherous life with a group of women in a hideout. He is then attacked by a wild dog, losing a finger. After the accident, a mixture of tragedy and comedy unfolds within him, intertwined with the gaping wounds of his fingers.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/68629985), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EC%A7%84%EC%8B%AC%EC%9C%BC%EB%A1%9C/4768)",
